{"availability":"available","full":"vandanlalwani-git/filing-wire","name":"filing-wire","description":"Live, rules-based feed of BSE and NSE corporate disclosures, coloured Adverse / Favourable / Unclassified by fixed, tested rules. No AI at runtime, zero running cost.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-01T17:12:11Z","updated":"2026-10-08T18:25:47Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://vandanlalwani-git.github.io/filing-wire/","topics":["bse","corporate-announcements","financial-data","github-actions","github-pages","india","nse","python","react","stock-market"],"demo":"https://vandanlalwani-git.github.io/filing-wire/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:03.924Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:03.924Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:03.924Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:26:03.924Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A live, rules-based feed of corporate disclosures from India's two stock exchanges, BSE and NSE.","Every announcement a listed company files with BSE or NSE appears here within minutes as a single line. Each line's colour shows its direction (Adverse, Favourable or Unclassified), and its weight shows how much it matters (Critical, Notable or Routine). A filing made on both exchanges is shown once.","Every decision comes from a fixed, published set of rules that has been tested against hand-labelled filings. No AI model is called at runtime. When the rules cannot tell whether news is good or bad, the filing stays Unclassified rather than guessed."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vandanlalwani-git/filing-wire/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cd830eec31d1e517acb80f982528851f85b34c8bbd469cdb4664d0cebea55fb2","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:04.068Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:04.068Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A live, rules-base